    <string name="trail_together_title">Trail Together</string>
    <string name="trail_together_tagline">Light the trail and get home before the fog!</string>
    <string name="trail_together_teaches">Planning ahead, matching colours and shapes, and taking turns as a team.</string>
    <string name="trail_together_help_title">Trail Together</string>
    <string name="trail_together_help_text">Everybody helps the hedgehog pals hop home along the trail. On your turn play one card: a hop card sends a pal to the next stone of that colour, a stone card lights a new stone at the end of the trail, and a lantern card does either one. When you have no good card, swap one. Fog cards make the fog roll closer, so get every pal to the burrow before it arrives. We win together or we try again together.</string>
