    <string name="trail_together_tutorial_1">These little hedgehogs want to get home to their cosy burrow.</string>
    <string name="trail_together_tutorial_2">The trail is made of coloured stones. Each colour has its own shape too.</string>
    <string name="trail_together_tutorial_3">A hop card sends a pal to the next stone of the same colour.</string>
    <string name="trail_together_tutorial_4">A stone card lights a new stone at the end of the trail.</string>
    <string name="trail_together_tutorial_5">A lantern card is a helper: light any stone, or hop one step.</string>
    <string name="trail_together_tutorial_6">When the fog cards come, the fog rolls closer. Watch the fog track!</string>
    <string name="trail_together_tutorial_7">Talk together. Which card helps a friend the most?</string>
    <string name="trail_together_tutorial_8">When every pal is home, we all win. Ready?</string>
